    "source": "Glissando (Library 042 drift-focus), lay: running bond, half-height offset (600 mm), rotation none: Library 042 manifest laying. The 600 x 1200 plate is two moulds T (upper half) and B (lower half), each 600 x 600; the neighbouring column starts half a plate lower, so the plan alternates T B / B T (period 2 x 2). Plain stacking would step 10.9 mm at every vertical joint, the bond-aware joint steps 4.76 mm. Gallery plan 6 x 4 modules (3.6 x 2.4 m); any other wall size continues the lay by its period (resize: tile, period 2 x 2). WIP in the composer: price open, no price.",
